==Trivia==
* The guild's entry requirement is described by the [[guildmaster]] as only allowing in adventurers that have proved themselves worthy by gaining influence from quests.{{CiteNPC|npc=Guildmaster|quote=This is the Champions' Guild. Only adventurers who have proved themselves worthy by gaining influence from quests are allowed in here.|loc=|notes=|name=}}
**{{RSCL|Influence}} is a deprecated [[skill]] from early in ''[[RuneScape Classic]]'' that was replaced by [[quest points]]. Before this, the guild required the highest possible amount of Influence to enter. Nowadays, the mention of "influence" could simply be seen as an in-universe representation of the quest point requirement.

